WEBVTT

00:03.090 --> 00:05.590
This is the lowest layer of the dungeon?

00:07.190 --> 00:08.480
It's beautiful.

00:08.870 --> 00:10.740
There are crystals everywhere.

00:10.740 --> 00:13.490
There's something comforting
about how warm it is.

00:13.860 --> 00:16.490
And I've never seen flowers 
like these before.

00:17.580 --> 00:19.240
<i>I've got a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:19.980 --> 00:22.750
<i>How is there mist at this temperature?</i>

00:26.260 --> 00:28.250
Note? Something wrong?

00:28.630 --> 00:32.510
These flowers...  I get the feeling 
we passed by here already.

00:33.080 --> 00:37.010
You think? Didn't we come 
in through there, though?

00:37.390 --> 00:40.510
In that case, why's 
there another entrance?

00:42.260 --> 00:44.520
No. There's only one entrance.

00:45.670 --> 00:47.420
I don't see any entrance.

00:47.420 --> 00:50.280
Then what are you looking at?
It's right there!

00:51.830 --> 00:54.450
Actually... I can't see it either.

00:54.450 --> 00:55.720
What's that mean?

00:56.390 --> 01:00.950
<i>This mist is showing each 
of us distinct illusions.</i>

01:02.050 --> 01:05.080
<i>Like it's hijacking our consciousness.</i>

01:05.730 --> 01:09.240
Everyone, don't be fooled 
by what you see.

02:43.260 --> 02:48.280
#6 The King Is Betrayed.

02:43.450 --> 02:46.520
It feels like my senses 
are going numb.

02:48.350 --> 02:49.250
Elijah!

02:51.670 --> 02:53.150
We need to leave, right away.

02:53.150 --> 02:56.580
Why? Are you chickening out?!

02:56.580 --> 02:59.280
We can leave after 
we find the magic stone!

02:59.280 --> 03:01.780
Do you not care if we're trapped in here?

03:02.010 --> 03:04.530
Just follow me, and it'll 
be easy to get out!

03:05.180 --> 03:07.540
Look at what happened to Brald already.

03:07.980 --> 03:10.290
I think we're better off continuing, too.

03:11.070 --> 03:15.790
See? Think of all the fame 
we'll earn by clearing this dungeon!

03:15.790 --> 03:20.290
I agree. I don't like the idea of 
giving up after coming all this way.

03:20.290 --> 03:22.050
And I could use the money.

03:22.050 --> 03:24.360
You're free to head back if you want.

03:24.360 --> 03:27.430
Maybe Brald should still be in charge?

03:27.740 --> 03:32.950
Note. I think we need to 
finish the job. Come with us.

03:32.950 --> 03:36.190
Hang on... What's gotten into you guys?

03:36.190 --> 03:40.190
Their desires have been manipulated 
since we made it in here.

03:40.550 --> 03:42.470
What do we do then, Note?

03:43.640 --> 03:45.340
Force them to come with us.

03:48.850 --> 03:49.860
Clara?

03:50.420 --> 03:52.580
Is that really you?

03:54.060 --> 03:55.330
Kriol?

03:55.890 --> 04:00.500
I knew it! I knew you couldn't have died!

04:01.650 --> 04:02.840
Don't go!

04:02.840 --> 04:06.350
Just wait! I'm coming to get you!

04:08.100 --> 04:10.100
Kriol, wait!

04:10.600 --> 04:12.100
Kriol!

04:13.580 --> 04:17.970
<i>This mist must be creating illusions 
out of the things we desire.</i>

04:22.770 --> 04:23.860
Brother?

04:24.440 --> 04:25.500
Lucas.

04:26.150 --> 04:27.370
Yes?

04:27.370 --> 04:29.150
Our Wykes family

04:29.150 --> 04:33.460
has the distinction of having led the 
Sapin Kingdom to victory against Elenoir.

04:34.010 --> 04:36.460
That makes us natural born 
humans of high standing.

04:37.210 --> 04:39.870
The ability to succeed 
no matter the circumstances

04:39.870 --> 04:41.750
proves you are a member of this family.

04:42.200 --> 04:47.010
I believe that you will one day become 
the ultimate mage, worthy of our house.

04:48.440 --> 04:50.030
You've done good work so far.

04:50.730 --> 04:54.270
No one is going to mock you for being 
the child of a slave, at this rate.

04:59.310 --> 05:01.530
If it weren't for you...

05:01.530 --> 05:02.830
Lucas!

05:05.710 --> 05:06.780
Are you okay?

05:08.360 --> 05:11.220
What? Then it wasn't really him?

05:14.340 --> 05:15.420
Father?

05:15.890 --> 05:17.540
Happy birthday to you.

05:18.050 --> 05:22.420
Everyone, Jasmine shall be 
sitting next to me today.

05:22.840 --> 05:26.290
Her talents should be prioritized 
and given proper attention.

05:27.800 --> 05:33.710
You truly are a fire mage worthy of 
being heir to the Flamesworth estate.

05:35.230 --> 05:37.550
Jasmine. Jasmine!

05:38.460 --> 05:41.540
Are you okay? You saw 
something, didn't you?

05:43.470 --> 05:46.580
Sorry. I'm just... a bit shocked.

05:47.150 --> 05:48.840
Did you see anything, Note?

05:48.840 --> 05:51.010
Nothing so far.

05:52.500 --> 05:54.080
Just the rest of you.

05:55.710 --> 06:00.180
Maybe because my biggest wish 
is keeping all of you safe.

06:04.690 --> 06:06.490
Damned mana beasts!

06:06.880 --> 06:10.720
I'm an A-rank adventurer!

06:11.010 --> 06:13.220
Brald! Get a grip!

06:14.110 --> 06:16.290
I finally found it.

06:19.050 --> 06:20.100
Samantha!

06:21.060 --> 06:24.230
Huh? What happened to my magic stone?

06:24.600 --> 06:26.410
It was never there.

06:29.880 --> 06:32.490
I want to go home.

06:32.790 --> 06:34.070
I know.

06:34.070 --> 06:38.750
But to start, you'll need to protect 
everyone from this mist with your magic.

06:39.310 --> 06:40.760
R-Right.

07:01.230 --> 07:03.780
Do you have magic that 
could get rid of this mist?

07:03.780 --> 07:08.650
I can't get rid of it, but maybe 
I can clear a path through it.

07:09.110 --> 07:11.660
Samantha, release the spell.

07:19.530 --> 07:21.920
What the hell is going on?!

07:23.290 --> 07:25.760
How didn't we notice them sooner?

07:25.760 --> 07:30.760
Showing us illusions with that mist 
must've been a way of luring us here.

07:32.780 --> 07:38.060
I'm an A-rank Augmenter. You think 
some overgrown plant can beat me?!

07:41.390 --> 07:44.310
Brald, you can't just 
lash out without a plan!

07:46.230 --> 07:48.570
He's lost his grip on reality 
because of the mist.

07:49.720 --> 07:51.570
Samantha, back Lucas up!

07:53.090 --> 07:53.950
Lucas!

07:53.950 --> 07:55.740
Yeah, I know!

08:08.830 --> 08:11.380
My spell didn't have any effect?

08:12.020 --> 08:14.380
Reginald and Elijah, protect the rear!

08:14.980 --> 08:17.190
Jasmine and I will cut us a path.

08:37.940 --> 08:40.660
This should work. Jasmine!

08:48.030 --> 08:49.670
Why's he able to manage?!

08:49.670 --> 08:51.920
We fight through here, and we get out!

08:52.220 --> 08:54.680
I'll keep all of you safe.

08:55.130 --> 08:59.180
<i>I'd rather not lose 
anyone ever again.</i>

08:59.670 --> 09:00.930
<i>Brald!</i>

09:08.150 --> 09:09.770
No more.

09:10.600 --> 09:12.030
<i>Are we reaching our limit?</i>

09:12.030 --> 09:13.140
Lucas!

09:13.140 --> 09:14.530
I said I get it!

09:20.280 --> 09:22.500
<i>The spreading fire should prove effective.</i>

09:23.420 --> 09:25.580
<i>But there's too much moisture in here.</i>

09:25.580 --> 09:27.790
<i>It won't be able to 
completely burn it out.</i>

09:28.140 --> 09:30.870
<i>I'd wager this plant's roots run deep,</i>

09:30.870 --> 09:33.980
<i>and wherever they lead, 
there's a large body of water.</i>

09:34.850 --> 09:39.250
Samantha, can you use your magic to 
evaporate the moisture in those vines?

09:39.570 --> 09:40.800
I can try.

09:49.060 --> 09:51.270
They've stopped regenerating?

09:54.120 --> 09:55.150
Thank you.

09:57.780 --> 10:01.200
Let's find Kriol and get out 
of here as fast as we can.

10:01.560 --> 10:04.610
Yeah. He should still be alive.

10:04.610 --> 10:09.460
Aw, damn it. Why can't anything 
go smoothly, just once?!

10:09.730 --> 10:12.460
I thought you guys were 
veteran adventurers!

10:12.930 --> 10:14.960
I should've never come down here!

10:15.250 --> 10:18.770
If you lot hadn't lied to by me, I would've
 never had to go through all this!

10:18.770 --> 10:19.720
Lucas!

10:21.720 --> 10:23.440
Who's Clara?

10:23.440 --> 10:25.970
She was Kriol's fiancee.

10:26.310 --> 10:27.230
She was?

10:27.540 --> 10:29.730
She died in a dungeon.

10:29.730 --> 10:33.980
Kriol came here because he wanted 
to fulfill the dream they shared.

10:34.350 --> 10:36.990
I want to help him make it 
happen, if possible.

10:37.660 --> 10:39.560
That's why you joined Brald.

10:44.380 --> 10:45.540
The mist...

10:45.540 --> 10:46.750
No way...

10:48.770 --> 10:51.040
Is nothing gonna work?!

10:51.040 --> 10:53.080
We'll need a more intense fire

10:53.080 --> 10:56.510
to evaporate the moisture in the vines
 and slow them down.

10:56.510 --> 10:58.450
We can still save Kriol!

11:08.120 --> 11:10.140
What... What is that?

11:12.420 --> 11:15.770
Don't tell me... It can't be...

11:16.200 --> 11:19.400
An S-class mana beast? Why?

11:19.420 --> 11:22.660
I've only read about this 
sort of thing before.

11:25.810 --> 11:27.900
It's an Elder Woods guardian spirit.

11:33.800 --> 11:35.990
The mist is coming from that beast, then.

11:40.840 --> 11:41.740
Kriol!

11:42.930 --> 11:46.600
Clara, don't leave me.

11:46.970 --> 11:48.200
Kriol...

11:48.790 --> 11:51.100
That's gotta be an illusion too, right?

11:51.390 --> 11:54.350
No. This is reality.

11:55.940 --> 12:00.110
A beast like you can't intimidate me!

12:10.040 --> 12:11.010
Brald!

12:15.090 --> 12:17.940
Don't! We can't fight this thing!

12:20.760 --> 12:22.110
Note!

12:28.360 --> 12:32.630
What is this?! This wasn't 
supposed to happen!

12:37.730 --> 12:38.860
Elijah!

12:46.240 --> 12:47.940
Let's get out of here together.

12:47.940 --> 12:48.980
Jasmine?

12:49.450 --> 12:50.990
What about the others?

12:50.990 --> 12:52.500
You know the answer.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.830
We can't save them all.

12:56.980 --> 13:01.000
I made a promise.
We'll get out of here alive.

13:01.390 --> 13:05.510
And I made a promise to your family!

13:07.990 --> 13:10.510
I remember very clearly...

13:12.830 --> 13:15.770
When I said I'd protect you this time.

13:26.340 --> 13:28.030
You overgrown pile of wood!

13:31.730 --> 13:33.290
We'll get out of here.

13:34.070 --> 13:38.070
But not just the two of us.
Everyone, together.

13:53.690 --> 13:56.230
Elijah! Back Brald up!

13:56.230 --> 13:58.480
We're heading back out the entrance!

13:58.830 --> 13:59.980
Got it!

14:17.830 --> 14:21.500
<i>Why? It seems to be 
targeting the two of them.</i>

14:28.510 --> 14:30.010
Kriol!

14:33.950 --> 14:36.740
<i>If we can't stop the main body of the 
Elder Woods, none of this will matter.</i>

14:37.570 --> 14:40.550
<i>But Samantha's magic won't be enough</i>

14:40.550 --> 14:43.270
<i>to divert the massive swell of water 
 flowing through its body.</i>

14:44.370 --> 14:45.170
<i>In that case...</i>

14:46.920 --> 14:50.070
<i>We need magic that burns 
more intensely than fire.</i>

15:18.970 --> 15:20.810
We need to leave while we can.

15:23.300 --> 15:25.220
Note, look...

15:29.060 --> 15:30.310
Note!

15:35.110 --> 15:37.580
<i>It can't be burnt down, it seems.</i>

15:38.090 --> 15:39.810
It wasn't supposed to be like this.

15:43.790 --> 15:44.950
Reginald!

15:46.840 --> 15:49.370
Lucas! Burn the vines!

15:50.440 --> 15:52.240
It wasn't supposed to...

15:52.240 --> 15:53.900
Now, Lucas!

15:58.920 --> 16:00.730
Lucas, are you all right?!

16:09.790 --> 16:12.990
This... This isn't me.

16:12.990 --> 16:15.240
Lucas, protect Samantha!

16:20.890 --> 16:23.500
I'm supposed to be the most exalted.

16:28.370 --> 16:29.490
<i>Those eyes.</i>

16:30.510 --> 16:33.800
<i>I've seen people with that look before.</i>

16:37.140 --> 16:42.020
My job is to survive and 
become the most powerful mage.

16:42.470 --> 16:45.750
It's my duty as a member 
of the renowned Wykes family.

16:47.900 --> 16:50.530
You want to protect us all, right?

16:51.000 --> 16:55.060
Then you need to sacrifice 
yourself so I can survive.

16:55.890 --> 16:56.910
<i>The look in his eyes...</i>

17:04.590 --> 17:07.560
<i>So you've made your choice.</i>

17:11.920 --> 17:13.800
Note!

17:13.800 --> 17:15.010
Jasmineâ€”

17:16.660 --> 17:18.550
What do you think you're doing?!

17:23.610 --> 17:28.210
Do you honestly think I'd risk my life 
for a bunch of commoners?

17:29.180 --> 17:32.570
My life is worth more than yours.

17:32.570 --> 17:35.070
I thought we were friends!

17:36.500 --> 17:37.820
Friends?

17:38.290 --> 17:41.110
You people are my happy little servants.

17:41.530 --> 17:45.890
By dying for me, you'll 
leave your mark on history.

17:46.730 --> 17:47.990
Lucas...

17:53.260 --> 17:58.510
I'll make sure everyone hears 
about how brave you were.

18:02.850 --> 18:06.520
I don't wanna die. Not like this!

18:09.520 --> 18:11.270
You're facing me!

18:32.730 --> 18:33.710
Brald?

18:38.600 --> 18:39.420
Note?

18:51.070 --> 18:53.820
It looks like there's no other way.

19:19.540 --> 19:22.720
The power that Virion,
elder statesman of the Elenoir Kingdom,

19:23.540 --> 19:26.430
took decades to master...

19:47.590 --> 19:48.620
<i>Papa?</i>

19:49.550 --> 19:52.930
I don't know if this power 
will help us survive,

19:57.620 --> 20:01.220
but I promised to keep them alive.

20:10.970 --> 20:12.460
Note?

20:30.540 --> 20:33.870
Absolute Zero!

20:49.250 --> 20:50.520
Just who are you?

20:53.750 --> 20:56.730
The Elder Woods was maintaining 
this whole chamber?

22:31.820 --> 22:33.860
This can't be...

22:34.430 --> 22:35.310
What is it?

22:35.810 --> 22:37.080
It's Arthur...

22:41.860 --> 22:43.390
Note...

22:44.470 --> 22:47.940
It's hard to believe he's only
 an A-rank Augmenter.
